silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_07_sections_03_concrete_anchor_2#phasestartstageindex silm:hasLongDescription "The PhaseStartStageIndex is the first stage in which Mittens is classified as adult (year-2-onward). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'n_phi^start', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
